        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Neihla mei munpuang tei tuai the",
            "Zianmei guai ta theimei rui duangkan the;",
            "Paap le rianra zingmei bam khou",
            "Kapma ai rui phu guang e",
            "Tat nipui chaeng tei ai rui thai makge.",
            "",
            "2. Kau sini hanguang dat lak khe",
            "Kaomei khuan luangbut rui kham kan the;",
            "Sui guang e Immanuel ram",
            "Gaimei kai ai tang maksan",
            "Khou tei rianra mei guai zaengthaek puni.",
            "",
            "3. Kandih rui ti neihla ngam mak",
            "Zaengsina ai kapbe tingmik kathui",
            "Salem thanh poubaomei ram khou,",
            "Zianmei nun ariupui nung",
            "Kaap nimei phei tei ai piudat lak khe.",
            "",
            "4. Jordan dui rui dailiam kan the,",
            "Kandii mei rung rui chaokan dat ngam mak;",
            "He Jisu na guanglou o",
            "Tingkao rung rui ai Jordan dui kaani."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
